{"content":[{"c":["KENAZ"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Singular form of the name of the Kenizzite tribe, whose land was promised to Abraham’s descendants (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.15.19","r":"Gen.15.19","rawR":"Gen.15.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.15.19","value":"Gen.15.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 15:19"},"). The appearance of three men by this name in the OT may be explained by the spread of the Kenizzite tribe over Edom and southern Judah before the Israelite conquest."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Grandson of Esau and chieftain of Edom (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.11,15,42","r":"Gen.36.11,15,42","rawR":"Gen.36.11,15,42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.11,15,42","value":"Gen.36.11,15,42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:11, 15, 42"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.36,53","r":"1Chr.1.36,53","rawR":"1Chr.1.36,53","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.36,53","value":"1Chr.1.36,53"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:36, 53"},")."],"sourceClass":"list-space","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Father of Othniel (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.17","r":"Josh.15.17","rawR":"Josh.15.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.17","value":"Josh.15.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.13","r":"Judg.1.13","rawR":"Judg.1.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.13","value":"Judg.1.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 1:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.9-11","r":"Judg.3.9-11","rawR":"Judg.3.9-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.9-11","value":"Judg.3.9-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"3:9-11"},") and Seraiah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.13","r":"1Chr.4.13","rawR":"1Chr.4.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.13","value":"1Chr.4.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Caleb’s descendant (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.15","r":"1Chr.4.15","rawR":"1Chr.4.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.15","value":"1Chr.4.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:15"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Kenizzites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Kenizzites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Kenizzites_Article